\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">by boat<br/>on a boat<br/>on board a boat</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"taxi\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">by taxi<br/>in a taxi</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "They prefer to travel by car.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We can spend the day on board a boat in the harbor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Let's take a taxi.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Get on the bus!", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "square", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an open area in a city with four equal sides", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They sit in the square in the evening and watch people walk by.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear when you talk about cities.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "stadium", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large structure for sports events", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our team is playing at the stadium this weekend.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sights", "type": "name"}, {"content": "interesting places to see in a city", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's go to Boston and see the sights!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tourist", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person visiting a city or country", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are many tourists in the art gallery.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pizzeria", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place that makes pizza", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: That pizzeria makes real Italian-style pizza!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "spot", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's go to all of the tourist spots in Boston!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "subway", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an underground train", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We can take the subway in Boston next time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le09ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Talking about a City", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about a city, you can use <span class = \"italic\">There is ... </span> or <span class = \"italic\">There are ... </span> to say what is there.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Singular\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Plural\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There is lots to see.<br />There is a pizzeria nearby.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There are lots of people around.<br />There are lots of tourists.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "There are a lot of pigeons!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "There is a great pizza place nearby.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think of a city you want to go to. Plan a trip.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Think about how you can get there.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Think about when it's a good time to go.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Think about what you want to see.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph about the trip. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write about transportation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about places to see in a city.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about plans for a trip.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}